aves, folded plastic cellophane, glossy silk ribbon, metallic foil, motherofpearl inlay or glass sculpture. No cast shadow, solid thickness, petal ridges, veins, natural tissue texture, specular globe reflections or embossed edges. Optical-film drainage curtains/dark windows supply image language, no normal leaf photograph with iridescent filter.\nAvoid polarised stress-isoclinic fine repeated rainbowfringes, diffractionhalo rings/radialcomb, projected3Dstripes, fine inkmarbling/combedveins, thick swirls of paint, capillary paperfronts/fibres, crystal/mineralterraces, interlocking shelltiles, fluorescent cellwalls, neonoutline/wireframe or glowing fairy plant. Do not show a hoop/frame/sheet rectangle, bubblewand, sphere, soapdish, lab apparatus or floor. No labels/ruler, text/numbers, molecular data, clock/date/battery/weather values, UI/logo/frame/watermark. This is ORIGINAL STATIC ARTISTIC thin-film image interpretation of a familiar clover silhouette, NOT a real leaf-shaped soap experiment, measured thickness/color map, authentic data or validated simulation. No chemical recipe/procedure, no external visual input, no named artist. All image areas inside leaflets remain opaque or nearlyopaque so darkwindows remain dark; TRUEalphaZERO only OUTSIDE exact whole clover/stalk. Transparent empty exterior, no background haze, glow or cast shadow beyond silhouette.",
